{"id":"fb520eeb2ca8e0fc","group":"68","path":"68/68-lem-borel-countable-separation.md","title":"Countable Union Separation Lemma","display":"lem-borel-countable-separation — Countable Union Separation Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-lem-borel-countable-separation","aliases":["68-lem-borel-countable-separation"],"display":"lem-borel-countable-separation — Countable Union Separation Lemma","depends_on":["[[68-df-borel-relation]]","[[68-df-separation-of-relations]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"20.4 proof lemma p.77 / PDF 86","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-lemma-and-local-set-argument-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-lem-borel-countable-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-lem-borel-countable-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-borel-countable-separation — Countable Union Separation Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61df304a04864967\" href=\"?note=61df304a04864967\" title=\"68-df-borel-relation\">68-df-borel-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1827d5ca5ea813ed\" href=\"?note=1827d5ca5ea813ed\" title=\"68-df-separation-of-relations\">68-df-separation-of-relations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"20.4 proof lemma p.77 / PDF 86"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-lemma-and-local-set-argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=X_{m,k}\">\\(X=X_{m,k}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(A,B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"61df304a04864967\" href=\"?note=61df304a04864967\" title=\"68-df-borel-relation\">68-df-borel-relation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Separates}_X\">\\(\\operatorname{Separates}_X\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1827d5ca5ea813ed\" href=\"?note=1827d5ca5ea813ed\" title=\"68-df-separation-of-relations\">68-df-separation-of-relations</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A(i),B(j),C)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_X\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}A(i),\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}B(j),D\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A(i),B(j),C)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_X\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}A(i),\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}B(j),D\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书证明中“不分离性对子分支保留”引理的逆否形式。选分离集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{i,j}\">\\(C_{i,j}\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\bigcup_i\\bigcap_j C_{i,j}\">\\(D=\\bigcup_i\\bigcap_j C_{i,j}\\)</span>。每个 A(i) 包含于所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{i,j}\">\\(C_{i,j}\\)</span>，故其并包含于 D；每个 B(j) 与每个内层交集不交，故与 D 不交。Borel 类对可数交、并闭合，保证 D 为 Borel。使用 ZFC 的可数选择，公式没有预设统一可计算的分离集选择器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-borel-relation","status":"resolved","id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-borel-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-separation-of-relations","status":"resolved","id":"1827d5ca5ea813ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-separation-of-relations]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-borel-relation","status":"resolved","id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X=X_{m,k}$；$A,B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X)$。$\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]，$\\operatorname{Separates}_X$ 见 [[68-df-separation-of-relations]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-separation-of-relations","status":"resolved","id":"1827d5ca5ea813ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X=X_{m,k}$；$A,B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X)$。$\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]，$\\operatorname{Separates}_X$ 见 [[68-df-separation-of-relations]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X=X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Separates}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_X(A(i),B(j),C)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}\\;\\operatorname{Separates}_X\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}A(i),\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}B(j),D\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"C_{i,j}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\bigcup_i\\bigcap_j C_{i,j}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{i,j}","display":false}],"bytes":1561,"backlinks":[{"id":"2b92bd908c1baefd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-lem-borel-countable-separation]] — lemma"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-lem-borel-countable-separation|lem-borel-countable-separation — Countable Union Separation Lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["61df304a04864967","1827d5ca5ea813ed"]}